OpenTaxSolver 2025, version 23.07 (tax year 2025), released 2025-09-25
on the project site and packaged 2026-09-25.

Upstream: https://opentaxsolver.sourceforge.net/
Package: OpenTaxSolver2025_23.07_linux64.tgz

The calculation programs are GPL-2.0-or-later. See COPYING and the
copyright header in each .c file. universal_pdf_file_modifier.c is
LGPL-2.0-or-later; its header is the license for that file.

This directory is a trimmed copy of that release, kept so a yearly
update is a source drop plus `npm run build:wasm`:

- src/*.c and src/Makefile are the engine. The GTK GUI (src/Gui_gtk)
  and the prebuilt Linux binaries (bin/) are not included. Those
  binaries are linked against a newer glibc than Hostinger provides,
  and Hostinger cannot compile them.
- src/formdata contains only the federal PDF backgrounds and metadata
  this app fills (Form 1040 including Schedules 1, B, and D / Form 8949
  pages that ship inside the 1040 package, Schedule C, Schedule SE, and
  Form 8995). Other states' PDF images were left out to keep the repo
  smaller. Their solver sources are still here.
- tax_form_files contains the input templates the adapter fills.

OpenTaxSolver 23.07 has no Utah TC-40 program. Utah is computed by
the small TypeScript worksheet in src/lib/ots/utah.ts, from the
published 2025 TC-40 instructions, using federal figures this engine
produces.
